<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on basket of tourism stocks.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on basket of tourism stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland's Hong Kong branch said it intended to issue 300 million American style call warrants on a basket of five tourism-related stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Travel Int'l Investment Hong Kong Ltd 0.63 shrs</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd				    0.40 shrs</p>
<p> Shangri-La Asia Ltd				 0.18 shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd		  0.20 shrs</p>
<p> Hongkong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd		0.16 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.08	 PREMIUM	   15.83 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2868	GEARING	   4.80x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  06.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 20.JAN.97</p>
<p>REFERENCE SPOT    HK$13.7678     LISTING DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
